Punctuation: –, —, %, #, @, †.

Currency: €, $, £, ¥.

Marks: •, ⋆, ✓, ©.

Quotes: “, ”, «, ».

Brackets: ⟦, ⟧.

Shapes: ◯, ⬤, ▶.

In math: <math display="inline">a \cdot b</math>, <math display="inline">a \pm b</math>, <math display="inline">a \bullet b</math>, <math display="inline">a \bullet b</math>.

More math: <math display="inline">a⟦b⟧</math>, <math display="inline">a ::= b</math>.
